Dear Kestrow colleagues,

Registration is now open for Teaching with AI, a half-day faculty workshop
hosted by the Office of Digital Strategy with TU Kestrow.

  When:   Thursday 4 March, 1:00-4:00pm
  Where:  Pellery Hall 112, Kestrow campus
  Who:    Faculty and instructional staff from all departments. No prior
          experience with AI tools is needed.

What to expect:
  - Keynote from Dr. Ines Vardakis (Eskerfield Learning Research Institute)
    on what the research does and does not yet tell us about AI feedback and
    student learning
  - A faculty panel with Kestrow colleagues
  - Hands-on tables: try a course assistant on your own syllabus and
    assignments, with help on hand
  - Time for questions, concerns and honest skepticism

Register here: https://forms.tarrow.example/twai-mar4

Registering helps us plan seating and materials. If you need an accessibility
accommodation, please note it on the form.

We look forward to seeing you there.

— ODS Team
